+* PARAMETERS
+* p_dma_info   [IN]        pointer to BTIF dma channel's information
+* p_buf     [IN]        pointer to rx data buffer
+* max_len  [IN]        tx buffer length
+* RETURNS
+*  0 means success, negative means fail
