+*  hal_btif_tx_mode_ctrl
+* DESCRIPTION
+*  set BTIF tx to corresponding mode (PIO/DMA)
+* PARAMETERS
+* p_base   [IN]        BTIF module's base address
+* mode     [IN]        rx mode <PIO/DMA>
